Requirements The kagekuma has a manifested bundle; 
Frequency once per day; 
Effect The kagekuma causes its bundle to vanish, Strides, and then attempts a kusarigama Strike and a bite Strike. A kagekuma's bundle is more than just a disguise and armor—it's a physical indication of how many lives they've cut short and how many souls they've supped upon. Whether the bundle is composed of straw, ropes, hair, or other materials, the individual lengths symbolize a sort of “reaper's harvest,” with each strand in the bundle representing a metaphorical lifeline that the nindoru has severed and collected— to an extent that the multitude of lives taken overwhelms the nindoru's own presence in the world.
